  <item>
    <title>058 王涵：在日本做刀、雕银饰、搞皮具，我怎么就成艺术家了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afa910ea4a79edf1379f89d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afa910ea4a79edf1379f89d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听东京无聊俱乐部，我们是一档在日本东京的闲聊访谈类节目。</span></p><p><span>✳️ 您可以添加「TokyoBBClub」的微信加入听友群！</span></p><p><span>本期我们跑到了埼玉県的吉川，找王涵喝酒聊天。</span></p><p><span>19岁拖着个大托运箱跑去日本师父家学做刀，后来被一位师父逐出师门，又稀里糊涂成了另一位师父的二代目。刀做着做着还不够，又折腾起银饰、皮具、产品设计，甚至往工作室里搬了台1.5吨的机器，还搞来了一百多头熊的材料做刀柄和皮具。</span></p><p><span>干的事越来越多，名堂也越来越多。刀匠？银匠？皮匠？设计师？或者，就是艺术家？</span></p><p></p><h2><span>🖼️ 相关图片：</span></h2><p><span>▼ Instagram / Wtopia Works：</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/wtopia.works/" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/wtopia.works/"><span>wtopia.works</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-kMr1y4iEAFnhG1R8x_xHEjdlk.jpg"><p><span>▼ Instagram / 素全：</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/sozen.sbkf/" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/sozen.sbkf/"><span>sozen.sbkf</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr80hBLQLmownrBeOqErh-g_6XxR.jpg"><p></p><p><span>▼ 小红书 / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f849ec0000000000100732d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f849ec0000000000100732d"><span>Wtopia-Maker</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs04LQYttfqZtoZjCAFP3UdHlvkf.jpg"><p><span>▼ 小红书 / </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5dd14e3f000000000100231d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5dd14e3f000000000100231d"><span>素全</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkcaj2amQWmQxZuaZKj8dHfL_zGv.jpg"><p></p><p><span>▼ 和福田桑</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvZsFBqFZ3ccZS9E6yTYMPnHHjTP.jpg"><p><span>▼ 素全</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuONCf6HUPAKPOSF3GzhakMN932W.jpg"><p><span>▼ 社交担当</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvagD_MnjKw_IVvNPpWmozF4twvp.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkZjsW2O56SAhryCBRQo4FvbBbPQ.jpg"><h2></h2><p><span>▼ 在工作室</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvsc1HwXZYsjkz1wgNcW24_xgzKC.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJgumKJNkCJUeS43hPzj6HivORO.jpg"><p></p><p><span>▼ 一些作品</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvxnojgEA946k9rgmYVcNJ1Ys2cQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkSHntd-qwTSHEO1K4I9OvKLBtV.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlCm604fJTkVAT79a6IU8i67EbJz.jpg"><p><span>▼ 熊掌</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomFUcP-aYxJ1ElNGxFWV0U-P9Ha.jpg"><h2><span>🎵 音乐：</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>ziproom - Dive</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
