  <item>
    <title>047 PEIEN创始人伊澤直子：从零基础开局到东京时装周，在针线间编织多重身份的艺术表达</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696616ff109824f9e14375b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696616ff109824f9e14375b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jan 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听东京无聊俱乐部，我们是一档在日本东京的闲聊访谈类节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>✳️ 您可以添加「TokyoBBClub」的微信加入听友群！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾 伊澤直子 (Izawa Naoko) 是二浩认识蛮久的朋友，她在东京做了一个独立设计师品牌 </span><a href="https://www.peien-i.com/" data-url="https://www.peien-i.com/"><span>PEIEN</span></a><span>。我们聊了她从小学油画到进入北京服装学院平面设计专业、再到零基础考入文化服装学院读研、经历职场霸凌后创业、最终登上东京时装周，甚至靠一句 I'm from Japan “混”进三宅一生巴黎秀场头排，用横机和针线编织出了自己的艺术人生的故事。</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>📝 相关图片：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>▼ PEIEN 的 Instagram</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlAoktqQG7ehZQOwhoGvhn1in44i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼ INSTALLATION SHOW 2022.03.15 Minami AOYAMA TOKYO Fashion Week</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkHBKYJkJJYNH1lW9PsRRW8wSQdc.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvyPHzpkSiKVtyXV6WEGkzrTKegh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5bkP8LaufPitH2SnAW5JriDfda.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopWUGo_Gel2TH8MPen0dvCEHloC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2tw7TmtTlI5UAm47WzlZSy88b4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr-7Pt3blzFrsycdHYUxe_zKOsfK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuk4UFP3MPlT268YUAlV5xlKZGf4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frir_sMTh7E3s0ah5N2P0KzJehtl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmi6J5vYuBeaJ2uu0YM_4tiefJVl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjyg9tm5eiZcSsHA3w9jk1dYPCG4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfOhPRextoB-tChPYITmKr_xaI0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgnRJnIQkUmF9uUFiFCcfmoRc-ZQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.